    old "That time passed, she could only faintly tell because the light of the sun slowly turned and then darkened."
    new "Ese momento pasó, y ella apenas pudo percibirlo porque la luz del sol giró lentamente y luego se oscureció."

    old "When only stars remained for illumination, they still ravaged her."
    new "Cuando solo quedaban las estrellas para iluminar el camino, aún la consumían."

