    old "As she forced herself to her feet, her thoughts were not with the guards or Alaric."
    new "A medida que se obligaba a ponerse de pie, sus pensamientos no estaban en los guardias ni en Alaric."

    old "Both seemed strangely distant. Part of that same, other life."
