    old "Save a rare few, she could hardly recall one face from the other, as years passed."
    new "Salvar a unas pocas, apenas recordaba una cara entre las demás mientras pasaban los años."

    old "She saved her coin well enough, lived within her means, and purchased a home in the city."
    new "Ahorró bien su moneda, vivió dentro de sus posibilidades y compró una casa en la ciudad."

    old "As she aged, she was wise that her days in the trade would not last forever."
