    old "But as she looked out over the streets that had become her home..."
    new "Pero mientras miraba hacia las calles que habían convertido en su hogar..."

    old "For whatever life it might have been, good or bad, she was always certain that it had been her life."
    new "Por lo que la vida pudiera haber sido, buena o mala, ella siempre estaba segura de que había sido su propia vida."

