    old "It was comforting to think there was a strategy, a plan. And who was she to argue? Alaric had years of experience, compared to her few weeks."
    new "Era reconfortante pensar que había una estrategia, un plan. ¿Y quién era ella para argumentar? Alaric tenía años de experiencia, comparado con sus pocas semanas."

    old "Okay...so..."
