    old "While she could spot a few guards from the corners of her eyes, they didn't seem to pay them much attention."
    new "Mientras podía distinguir a unos pocos guardias en los rincones de su visión periférica, no parecían prestarles mucha atención."

    old "They moved quick, cutting and dashing through the crowds."
    new "Se movían rápido, cortando y zambulléndose entre la multitud."

